---
import PolicyLayout from '../layouts/PolicyLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<PolicyLayout
  title="Shipping and Returns"
  heading="Shipping and <em>returns</em>"
  description={`${site.name} shipping times, rates and our ${site.returnWindowDays}-day return policy.`}
  path="/shipping-returns/"
  updated="October 2026"
>
  <h2>Shipping</h2>
  <p>
    Orders are processed within 1 to 2 business days. Standard delivery typically takes 3 to 7 business days after
    your order ships. As soon as your order leaves our warehouse you will receive a confirmation email with tracking
    details.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Free standard shipping on orders over ${site.freeShippingThreshold}</li>
    <li>A flat rate applies to orders under ${site.freeShippingThreshold} and is shown at checkout</li>
    <li>Larger items such as rugs may ship separately</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Returns</h2>
  <p>
    We want you to love every piece. If something is not right, you can return unused items in their original
    condition within {site.returnWindowDays} days of delivery for a full refund to your original payment method.
  </p>
  <p>
    To start a return, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> with your order number and the items
    you would like to send back. We will reply with a prepaid return label and instructions.
  </p>

  <h2>Exchanges</h2>
  <p>
    Need a different size or colour? The fastest option is to return the original item and place a new order. If you
    need help, our team is happy to arrange an exchange for you.
  </p>

  <h2>Damaged or incorrect items</h2>
  <p>
    If anything arrives damaged or is not what you ordered, contact us within 7 days of delivery with a photo and we
    will send a replacement at no cost.
  </p>
</PolicyLayout>
